{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassEndomorphism.DeltaMaxUniformBound","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.DeltaMaxUniformBound","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.AbsoluteValue.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.JetTowerUniformDeltaMax"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.toJetTowerUniformDeltaMax","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.toJetTowerUniformDeltaMax","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L99-L110","doc":"An `OperatorNormBound` discharges the\n`JetTowerUniformDeltaMax` conjectural class for the same\nvortex `ρ`.  This is the **closure of the archimedean /\nrank-1 SDP regime** of the convergence conjecture\n(`conj:jet-tower-uniform-delta-max`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.delta_max_uniform_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.delta_max_uniform_bound","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L84-L97","doc":"**Δ_max uniform bound (Archimedean / rank-1 SDP regime).**\n\nFor a vortex `ρ` carrying an `OperatorNormBound`, the\nper-level residual is uniformly bounded by `deltaMax`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:delta-max-uniform-bound","label":"prop:delta-max-uniform-bound","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-max-uniform-bound.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.deltaMax_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.deltaMax_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L74-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.deltaMax","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.deltaMax","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L68-L72","doc":"The closed-form `Δ_max(ρ) := 2 · L(β) · ‖ρ(β)‖_op² ·\n𝔪⁽⁰⁾(ρ_free)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.per_level_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.per_level_bound","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The proven per-level bound (Steps 1–4 of the .md proof). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.delta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.delta","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.freeMassLevel0_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.freeMassLevel0_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.freeMassLevel0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.freeMassLevel0","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.opNorm_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.opNorm_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.opNorm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.opNorm","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.braidLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.braidLength","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.OperatorNormBound","kind":"structure","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/DeltaMaxUniformBound.lean#L43-L66","doc":"**Operator-norm bound data** for a vortex `ρ` with braid\nrepresentative `β ∈ B_n`.\n\nCaptures the four quantities needed for the Δ_max uniform\nbound:\n* `braidLength` = `L(β)`,\n* `opNorm` = `‖ρ(β)‖_op` on the Jones–Wenzl module,\n* `freeMassLevel0` = `𝔪⁽⁰⁾(ρ_free)`,\n* `delta` = the per-level residual,\nalong with their non-negativity.\n\nAll quantities are real-valued (Archimedean tier). ","signatureChunk":0}]}